<title>USA: Apple sees Q1 operating loss.</title>
<headline>Apple sees Q1 operating loss.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc., citing weak consumer demand for some of its computers, said Friday it expects to report an operating loss of as much as $150 million for the first quarter ended in December.</p>
<p>In a statement, the computer maker said revenues for the quarter are expected to be about 10 percent below the $2.3 billion reported in the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
